    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp3221936">[cuach]</headword>
      <description>“Is minig a dh’fhàg mi mar thraill gun luach, ’s tha liuthad treun fhear is laoch thug buaidh, le neart na Gaidhlig chuireadh càch ’s an ruaig. An àm dhaibh eirigh leis an fheilleadh chuaich (pleated).” – a war cry for the clans going into battle.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp3220712">sgur urrainn</headword>
      <description>the war cry of the MacRaes of Kintail. This phrase repeated to build up the battle tempo.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp3218624">[gort]</headword>
